13. Untreated sleep condition.
14. Medically diagnosed kidney disease (except for chronic stable kidney disease with eGFR\>45);
15. Medically diagnosed acute narrow-angle glaucoma;
16. Allergic to ketamine, benzodiazepines, flumazenil;
17. With poor IV access;
18. National Institute of Nursing Research (NINR) employees or subordinates, relatives, and/or co-workers of NINR employees/staff or study investigators;
19. Pregnant or lactating individuals;
20. Ongoing medical condition that is deemed by the Principal Investigator to interfere with the conduct or assessments of the study or safety of the participant.
